BEGIN_DESC
Fly the short ISS approach from the stock DeltaGlider panel. After the cockpit switch, the glider brakes with its translation thrusters. Watch DST and CVEL on the left Docking MFD before the camera returns outside.
END_DESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Script ISSPilot
  Date MJD 51982.0975169074
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship DG-01
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET DG-01
  MODE Extern
  POS 6.83 52.96 -13.52
  TRACKMODE GlobalFrame
  FOV 60.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_HUD
  TYPE Docking
END_HUD

BEGIN_MFD Left
  TYPE Docking
  NAV 0
END_MFD

BEGIN_MFD Right
  TYPE Orbit
  PROJ Ship
  REF Earth
  TARGET ISS
END_MFD

BEGIN_PANEL
END_PANEL

